<!-- ===== 13. FAQ ACCORDION (6 Questions) ===== -->
<section class="s-faq-accordion" id="why">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header-center" data-reveal="fade-up">
      <span class="section-tag-pill">FAQ</span>
      <h2 class="section-title-large">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin-top: 10px;">Everything you need to know about our personal 1-on-1 learning experience.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-container-list" data-reveal="fade-up" data-reveal-delay="1">

      <div class="faq-accordion-item" data-faq-item>
        <button class="faq-q-btn" data-faq-question aria-expanded="false">
          Can beginners or non-IT students join Osian Academy?
          <span class="faq-indicator">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a-body">
          <p>Absolutely. Our courses are designed for all levels &mdash; from complete beginners to working professionals looking to upskill. Every programme begins with fundamentals and your dedicated instructor adapts the pace to your starting point.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-accordion-item" data-faq-item>
        <button class="faq-q-btn" data-faq-question aria-expanded="false">
          What makes 1-on-1 training different from group classes?
          <span class="faq-indicator">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a-body">
          <p>In group classes you're one of 30+ students going at an average pace. In 1-on-1 sessions, 100% of the instructor's time is dedicated to you. You can ask unlimited questions, dive deeper into difficult topics, and schedule sessions around your timetable.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-accordion-item" data-faq-item>
        <button class="faq-q-btn" data-faq-question aria-expanded="false">
          How does the 100% placement assistance work?
          <span class="faq-indicator">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a-body">
          <p>Students receive: resume &amp; portfolio review, LinkedIn profile building, technical mock interview sessions, referrals to our hiring partner network, and dedicated career counselling until you secure an offer.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-accordion-item" data-faq-item>
        <button class="faq-q-btn" data-faq-question aria-expanded="false">
          Are Osian Academy certifications recognised?
          <span class="faq-indicator">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a-body">
          <p>Yes. Osian Academy certifications are verifiable online with unique verification IDs and recognized by our network of hiring partners. For select tracks, we also prepare you for global certifications such as AWS, Microsoft Azure, Google Cloud, and CompTIA.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-accordion-item" data-faq-item>
        <button class="faq-q-btn" data-faq-question aria-expanded="false">
          Do you provide practicals and hands-on training?
          <span class="faq-indicator">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a-body">
          <p>Every course includes live projects, assignments, and hands-on exercises conducted during sessions with your mentor. You graduate with a complete project portfolio demonstrating real-world skills to employers.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-accordion-item" data-faq-item>
        <button class="faq-q-btn" data-faq-question aria-expanded="false">
          What makes Osian different from other training institutes?
          <span class="faq-indicator">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a-body">
          <p>The 1-on-1 model. Every single session is private, live, and conducted by a dedicated expert instructor. No batch lectures, no generic recordings. Combined with personalized career support, Osian provides a level of individual attention that no other platform offers at scale.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

